## 1. System Overview & Core Capabilities

The **ASM AI Assistant** is an enterprise-grade, privacy-first, on-premise RAG platform engineered specifically for smart manufacturing, operator support, failure analysis, and machine log analytics. It operates 100% offline (air-gapped capable) to guarantee data privacy, low latency, and zero dependency on external cloud services.

### Key Capabilities at a Glance
- 💬 **Conversational Multi-Turn RAG**: Context-aware Q&A with token streaming (SSE) via Ollama, maintaining session history up to 5 conversation exchanges.
- 🎯 **Multi-Intent Routing**: Automatic LLM-based classification of queries into `CASUAL`, `GENERAL`, `DOCUMENT`, `FA_REPORT`, `BOM_QUERY`, or `LOG_QUERY`.
- 🔍 **Hybrid Multi-Vector Retrieval**: Combines BM25 keyword search, dense vector retrieval (ChromaDB / Endee), SPLADE sparse caching, and Cross-Encoder reranking (`ms-marco-MiniLM-L-6-v2`).
- 📈 **Feedback Learning & Trust Scores**: Continuous reinforcement loop adjusting document chunk "trust scores" based on user upvotes/downvotes to optimize future retrieval.
- 🤖 **LangGraph Autonomous Agents**:
  - **Failure Analysis (FA) Agent**: State-driven multi-step diagnosis, report extraction, and PowerPoint (`.pptx`) report generation.
  - **QuestDB Log Diagnostic Agent**: Time-series log processing, root cause tracing, voltage/pressure anomaly detection, and predictive health scoring.
- 🧩 **Multimodal Ingestion**: Ingests PDFs (with image extraction), PPTX, CAD files (`.dwg`/`.dxf`), Schematics, and Motion Configs using Docling-structured chunking.
- 🔒 **Enterprise Security & RBAC**: Station-level and category-level permissions, regex guardrails, Nginx file-auth proxy with signed cookies for raw document previews, and full audit provenance logging.

